      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1433607963,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I am not a lawyer, so I do not really know.\n\nThe Scapy code seems to be somewhat a leak and I assume there was an NDA broken.\nWhile I have a dissector for Wireshark, which has more features, I cannot break the NDA.\n\nTo avoid legal trouble for the Wireshark project, closing the pull request might good good for now.\n\nI will talk to BMW and see, if they want to release a dissector for Wireshark but that will take weeks or months from my experience.",
