        {
          "id": 1433945505,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "That's not an NDA compliance issue. I don't know with 100% certainty that giving semantic meaning to the bits in the network doesn't break any IP laws world-wide, I don't think so, but that applies to any dissector for proprietary protocols. It's never been a problem AFAIK.\n\nIt might be a problem for you personally to contribute to this dissector though, if you've entered into an NDA. I would assume it is in fact.",
